  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase" ADogSaidBody="LegsTail">
    <defName>RSW_Blurrg</defName>
    <label>blurrg</label>
    <description>Blurrgs are two-legged, non-sentient reptiles used as beasts of burden and mounts on a number of worlds across the galaxy. A blurrg has two short arms ending in two clawed fingers, a thick tail that helps it balance, and hip joints set unusually high on its body. Its large mouth holds many sharp teeth that can chew through most materials, including grasses and weeds, but it is not strictly a herbivore and will eat other organisms, even its own kind. Fast, strong and ill-tempered when provoked, a blurrg answers to whoever broke it.</description>
